    "text": "The secondary valency and the number of hydrogen bonded water molecule(s) in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>5</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>,&nbsp;respectively, are"
